{
  "_comment": "Curated router triggers for plugin skills (audit A-05). Plugin SKILL.md files carry no metadata, so their keywords came from the description at half weight (cap 2.0) and 30 of 32 could never reach the 3.0 floor. scripts/build_skills_index.py merges each entry into the per-machine sidecar state/skills-index.plugins.json with source 'plugin' (full weight). keywords are word-boundary phrases (> 3 chars after tokenizing); intents are router categories (DEBUG, PLAN, REVIEW ...); surfaces may be empty. A plugin skill with no entry here stays description-derived and half weight. Local skills that cover the same ground keep their own metadata; both can be pushed (max_skill_pushes).",
